{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：20:32 2026-08-25 HKT</p>\n\n<p>深水埗南昌街近荔枝角道交界，今日（8月25日）晚上近7時，一名男子從高處墮下，撞到路邊一部貨車後再彈落地面。救援人員趕至，當場證實男子死亡。警員其後用綠色帳篷覆蓋遺體，待仵工到場舁走遺體。目前男子墮樓原因仍在調查。</p>\n<img alt=\"男子墮樓後撞到路邊貨車車頂，再彈落地重創不治。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fed4f3f0bf5ff41585f4f1c1f2a91218/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_19_44_07_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男子墮樓後撞到路邊貨車車頂，再彈落地重創不治。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b3a571abc8f9d36a2455c3fb1d6485b9/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_19_44_07.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員用綠色帳篷覆蓋遺體。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/648fa95777686563755dc553f2d4df9e/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_19_44_07_1__0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員用綠色帳篷覆蓋遺體。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45892562be01de86db564f5ba905095b/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_19_44_04_2__0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男子墮樓原因仍在調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b5f7403e0d7be2b87fa3c7adc61c02c/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_19_44_05_1.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男子墮樓原因仍在調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9ac64c7fb2ff9ea3595dacc57207872d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-25_at_19_44_08_0.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T12:39:58.123986+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}